title: mf_ignore
tags: [[Reserved field]] [[Ignore presets]]
kind: reference
summary: An ignore pattern on a directory, one row per pattern; the nearest directory holding some decides.

A regular expression tested against a candidate's path relative to its tracking scope.
The nearest ancestor with at least one row provides the whole set — sets are not
merged ([[Watch and ignore fields]]). The daemon writes none: the familiar patterns
are the `default` preset a client applies at init ([[Ignore presets]]).
